continued evaluation and documentation of policies, processes, and controls, both manual and automated;

identification and implementation of improvements to information technology and security controls and supporting control documentation;

evaluation of and updates to software workflows to further segregate duties, enhance accuracy of vendor billing, and ensure transparency and oversight from vendor or project managers, department leaders, legal team members, and finance team members;

